# Large open-source model exports don't belong in git (GitHub blocks pushes
# over 100MB without Git LFS; stutter_vocametrix.onnx runs ~1.2GB). The small
# custom-trained models (CNN + two-head gate, ~5.7MB each) stay tracked as
# usual; anything else in models/ is a regenerate-locally artifact — see
# ml/stutter/export_onnx.py, export_onnx_twohead.py, export_onnx_vocametrix.py.
server/models/*.onnx
server/models/*.json
!server/models/stutter.onnx
!server/models/stutter.json
!server/models/stutter_gate.onnx
!server/models/stutter_gate.json
